{"title":"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which one of the following integers can be expressed as the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> consecutive positive integers?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/2/d329cc0fcf33948736ebf035a53b647e81bf3f21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1,\\!627,\\!384,\\!950\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2,\\!345,\\!678,\\!910\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3,\\!579,\\!111,\\!300\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4,\\!692,\\!581,\\!470\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 5,\\!815,\\!937,\\!260$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"833\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> integers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/7/ce7007784b17aa47a4644c5f9e1d7dcaa57a8e7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100\\cdot 101}{2} = 5050$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"131\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>If you add an integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> to each of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> numbers, you get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/2/aa247a44b96a63a3d6636532d50d99588f29076d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5050 + 100k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />, which is the sum of the numbers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/5/f05f085f774fc8ab50676b778b86a1f1d1114fc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/5/6f51bd5d8c4ab1ce5bc3d122894468cc1889df00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k+100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>You're only adding multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, so the last two digits will remain unchanged.\n</p><p>Thus, the only possible answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" />, because the last two digits are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>As an aside, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/a/f8a296cc6236917825b27114ba869e81e7b945e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5050 + 100k = 1627384950$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"210\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/6/b967d31a2cc2761170a3c5fa71dc208b054e3a20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 16273799$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"106\" height=\"13\" />, and the numbers added are the integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/a/baa9bee7698bc47791a34e32fd2bd56fbf6d8212.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16273800$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/0/960642b965b75e581b37f9238d198d36baceea14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16273899$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice how the sum of 100 consecutive integers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/e/22e5ea7ff8ebaa93f8235cc25045f592f73d010b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-49)+(x-48)+(x-47)...+x+...(x+47)+(x+48)+(x+49)+(x+50)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"649\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>Cancelling out the constants give us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/5/955a8a20c927155b0bbc7ec46881ae81c9a9d90e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100x + 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"77\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Looking over at the list of possible values, we quickly realise that the only possible solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME\" title=\"1997 AHSME\">1997 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\